{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-601724688808346330 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/bg1v1z-zg/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=601724688707617498&sectionId=601724688808346330)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmUQ4yhk9M_text","label":"ggmUQ4yhk9M_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:24px;\"><strong>1. It Fixes What Your Doctor Never Tested</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfgzAhzKNO_text","label":"ggfgzAhzKNO_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.77);color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>You've seen 3, 5, maybe 7 doctors.&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.77);color:#000000;font-size:15px;\"><strong>They all tested TSH. They all said \"you're fine.\" Meanwhile you're eating 900 calories and gaining. Here's what they missed:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.77);color:#000000;font-size:15px;\"><strong>TSH tells you if keys are being SENT. It doesn't tell you if the keys WORK. Your body makes two types:</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.77);color:#000000;font-size:15px;\"><strong>T3 — real keys that open your metabolism</strong></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.77);color:#000000;font-size:15px;\"><strong>Reverse T3 — broken keys that jam the lock</strong></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.77);color:#000000;font-size:15px;\"><strong>Hypothyroid bodies make broken keys instead of real ones.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.77);color:#000000;font-size:15px;\"><strong>They slide into your receptors. Get stuck. Block the real ones from getting in.</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.77);color:#000000;font-size:15px;\"><strong>They point at your \"perfect\" TSH while your locks were jammed shut.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.77);color:#000000;font-size:15px;\"><strong>Peak Form stops your body from making broken keys — and clears the ones already stuck.</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggF8YbKOUfQ_text","label":"ggF8YbKOUfQ_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:24px;\"><strong>2. It's Liquid — Not Pills Your Gut Can't Absorb</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggugnRQOg1z_text","label":"ggugnRQOg1z_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:16px;\">You've tried supplements before. Felt nothing.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>It wasn't a scam. Your gut couldn't absorb it.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Hypothyroidism wrecks your gut. Low stomach acid. Damaged lining. Years of inflammation.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Pills have to survive your stomach AND absorb through destroyed intestines. Most don't. They go in and come right back out. You pooped out your money.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Peak Form is liquid.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Drops absorb under your tongue. Skip the stomach. Skip the gut. Straight to the bloodstream.&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Up to 10x better absorption than pills.</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNmlRCYlIt_text","label":"ggNmlRCYlIt_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:24px;\"><strong>3. It Has The Exact Ratio Most Supplements Get Wrong</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguchbBBxCZ_text","label":"gguchbBBxCZ_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#020202;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Your thyroid needs iodine to build hormone.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#020202;font-size:16px;\">Your thyroid needs <strong>selenium</strong> to make it REAL instead of broken.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#020202;font-size:16px;\"><strong>The ratio matters more than the ingredients.</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color:#020202;font-size:16px;\">Iodine alone = more broken keys</span></li><li><span style=\"color:#020202;font-size:16px;\">Selenium alone = nothing to convert</span></li><li><span style=\"color:#020202;font-size:16px;\">Random doses = expensive pee</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"color:#020202;font-size:16px;\">Peak Form has the <strong>exact 2:1 selenium-to-iodine ratio</strong> that forces proper conversion.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#020202;font-size:16px;\">Most supplements guess. This one doesn't.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr_djrqOsZ_text","label":"ggr_djrqOsZ_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>4. It Stops Your Body From Making MORE Broken Keys</strong>&nbsp;</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfaR67brhU_text","label":"ggfaR67brhU_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Nobody told you this:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Every diet you tried made it worse.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">When you cut to 1,200... 1,000... 800 calories — your body panicked. Thought a famine was coming.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">So it made MORE Reverse T3. More broken keys. Jammed your locks tighter.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Every 900-calorie day? <strong>You were shoving more broken keys into already-jammed locks.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">That's wh